{"id":"n073556fe5d","headline":"‘Investors will be happy’: Zambia’s pro-business president wins second term","summary":"Hakainde Hichilema was declared the winner of Zambia's elections, an outcome investors will welcome as he builds on economic successes in Africa's second-biggest copper producer. The result extends his rule.","why":"Zambia is Africa's second-largest copper producer, so its political stability and mining policy matter to global copper supply. Investor confidence in its government affects sovereign debt and mining investment.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Lusaka","country":"Zambia","lat":-15.42,"lon":28.28,"region":"af"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"News24","url":"https://www.news24.com/business/economy/investors-will-be-happy-zambias-pro-business-president-wins-second-term-20260818-0489"},"sources":[{"name":"News24","url":"https://www.news24.com/business/economy/investors-will-be-happy-zambias-pro-business-president-wins-second-term-20260818-0489"}],"published_at":"2026-08-18T08:09:33Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"037ead0ff2ec9894","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-18T08:09:33Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-18T09:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"ZA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/copper-mine-7320158.jpg","alt":"copper mine (illustration)","credit":"Erik_Karits","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/butterfly-lycaena-dispar-7320158/"}}